          We narrowed to four disciplines we could genuinely be excellent at, and said no to the rest.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="glass p-7 relative reveal">
        <span class="absolute top-6 right-7 text-5xl font-bold font-display text-white/[0.06]">03</span>
        <div class="service-icon mb-5"><i class="fas fa-users"></i></div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2.5">Building the Team</h3>
