        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="glass p-7 relative reveal">
        <span class="absolute top-6 right-7 text-5xl font-bold font-display text-white/[0.06]">04</span>
        <div class="service-icon mb-5"><i class="fas fa-rocket"></i></div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2.5">Today</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          30+ companies, 50+ projects shipped, and the same weekly-demo promise we started with.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

